:: Witch Intro
<<npc "Pruti">><<person1>>
You awaken from your stupor feeling oddly... stiff. When you try to move, you hear a sharp click. A cursory glance at your body reveals your skin to be some kind of fabric. You gasp in horror, but you fail to make a sound. Whatever happened to your body seems to be somewhat impeding your ability to talk. You're about to make an attempt to ascertain your surroundings when you notice a shadow looming over you. You look up.
<br><br>
It takes you a few seconds to mentally grasp what you're seeing. There appears to be a <<beasttype>> with a smug expression on <<bhis>> face standing above you. "Good morning, doll," <<bhe>> purrs. "It seems the ritual worked perfectly."
<br><br>
The <<beasttype>> introduces <<bhimself>> as Pruti, a powerful witch with a penchant for turning <<bhis>> enemies into inanimate objects. <<bHe>> explains that <<bhe>> conducted a ritual on you to remove your soul and put it into a doll, and that you'll remain in this state until <<bhe>> decides otherwise.
<br><br>
Suddenly, a swarm of elongated arms appear and begin brushing through your hair and face, as if they were getting you ready for your day. "There, there, my little doll," the <<beasttype>> whispers. "Now you belong to me. You will do everything I say, understand?"
<br><br>
"Don't worry," <<bhe>> adds, "I'll take good care of you. I'm sure you'll make a adorable addition to my collection."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut]]>><<set $prutibinding to 20>><<endevent>><</link>>


:: Witch Hut
<<npc "Pruti">><<person1>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	<<towelup>>
<</if>>
<<set $fatigue to 0>>
<<if $prutibinding is 0>>
	<span class="red">
		The bindings slip and break away.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 5>>
	<span class="pink">
		The bindings feel very loose and nearly fall off.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 10>>
	<span class="purple">
		The bindings still feel quite firm.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 15>>
	<span class="blue">
		The bindings hold strong against any struggle you can manage.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<<elseif $prutibinding lt 20>>
	<span class="lblue">
		The bindings are pristine and strong.
		<br><br>
	</span>
<</if>>


<<if $NPCName[$NPCNameList.indexOf("Pruti")].love gte 20 and Time.dayState is "day">>
	<<set $syndromepruti to 1>>
	Suddenly, your bindings loosen and disappear. Pruti approaches you and whispers into your ear. "You've been good thus far. You can move around but don't even think about leaving. Got it?" <<bHe>> steps back and lets you stand before returning to what <<bhe>> was doing. <<bHe>> doesn't seem to mind as you return to your original form.
	<br><br>
	<span class="red">You've gained the Stockholm Syndrome: Pruti trait.</span>
	<br><br>
	<<if $bodyless is 1>>
        <<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>>
            <<set Skin.color.natural to "ghost">>
            <<set V.transformationParts.ghost.eyes to "default">>
            <<set V.transformationParts.ghost.hitodama to "default">>
            <<set $haircolour to "ghost">>
            <<set $hairfringecolour to "ghost">>
            <<set $makeup.browscolour to "ghost">>
            <<set $options.lightGlow to 1>>
            <<set $ghost to 1>>
        <</link>>
    <<else>>
        <<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><</link>>
    <</if>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 6>>
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
	<br><br>
	Pruti lies still in <<bhis>> bed asleep. If anything, now is your time to act.
	<br><br>
	<<if $prutibinding gt 0>>
		<<link [[Try to break your bindings (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<set $prutibinding -= 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Flee (0:30)|Witch Hut Flee]]>><<pass 30>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 8 and $prutibinding is 0>>
	You start to fall asleep before you're awaken with a start by Pruti. "What's this?!" <<bHe>> yells as he finds your bindings broken. "Your bindings broke overnight and... you chose to stay? I... W-wait..." <<bHe>> seems confused. "Do you not want to be free?" <<bHe>> mutters confused to <<bhimself>> as <<bhe>> fixes your bindings and walks away.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 5>><<set $prutibinding to 20>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 8>>
	
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
	<br><br>
	Pruti is sitting eating a meal of meat and herb. <<bHe>> seems to wince every few bites due to the bitter taste. 
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour is 12>>
	
	Pruti shifts and sits up, stretching <<bhis>> legs and reaching <<bhis>> arms high above <<bhis>> head. <<bHe>> then grabs a bag from the ground and began filling it with supplies such as food, water, and other essentials. <<bHe>> was getting ready to go scavenging and was taking you along to keep you from getting any ideas.
	<br><br>
	"Don't even think about trying to escape, doll," <<bHe>> said as <<bhe>> places the supplies in <<bhis>> bag. "I'll be watching you like a hawk."
	<br><br>
	With that, <<bhe>> picks up the bag and makes <<bhis>> way towards the door. "Come on, we need to go before the light fades," <<bHe>> says as <<bhe>> opens the door and steps outside. You follow <<bhim>>, feeling somewhat nervous about the whole situation.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Witch Forage]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour lte 19>>
	
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
	<br><br>
	Pruti sits idly riding a book. <<bHe>> occasionally looks up from the book to draw a sigil on the desktop before returning to reading. The entire room has a sort of ominous vibe. 
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Wait (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<elseif Time.hour is 20>>
	
	Pruti gets up and glances your way before walking to the other room and returning with a bucket of water. <<bHe>> lifts your arm and begins to wash your fabric.
	<br><br>
	"It's important to stay clean, doll," <<bHe>> said as <<bhe>> continues to wipe you down.
	<br><br>
	Pruti pauses before stripping, <<bhe>> pays no mind to you seeing <<bhis>> nudity as <<bhe>> begins to wipe down <<bhis>> own body as well. "Don't be a prude. Where I'm from there's nothing wrong with living naturally." <<bHe>> finishes wiping down before placing the bucket back into the other room. "I am going to sleep. Don't cause trouble, doll."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (1:00)|Witch Hut]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

<<else>>
	
	You're within a small hut bound among a pile of other dolls. Rain pitter patters against the roof as fire crackles in the corner. The fire looks to be part of a chemistry set? A box of red flame flickers angrily underneath, bubbling some sort of strange liquid above. 
	<br><br>
	Pruti lies still in <<bhis>> bed asleep. If anything, now is your time to act.
	<br><br>
	<<if $prutibinding gt 0>>
