:: Pruti Potion Use
You throw the potion toward Pruti who, without flinching, smashes the glass, spreading the liquid through the room. Pruti lets out a gutteral growl and cleans <<bhis>> face with <<bhis>> long tongue. "This is your last warning..." <<bHe>> pants as <<bhe>> gets into a pouncing stance <<bhis>> eyes wild.
<br><br>
<<link [[Surrender|Pruti Punishment]]>><<npcincr Pruti love 2>><<endevent>><</link>>
