:: Pruti Fire Use
You open the jar of fire. The flame rises from the jar cautiously wisping around. You hear a faint "Thank you" just before the mystical pyre engulfs your body. Your physical form burns to ash as your spirit is set free from the vessel. "No... problem," You hear yourself mutter as you are undone.
<br><br>
Pruti grins a long fangy smile. The fleshy tendrils brush you gently. "I can still tear you apart and put you back together..." <<bHe>> pants as <<bhe>> gets into a pouncing stance <<bhis>> eyes wild.
<br><br>

