:: Pruti Punishment
<<npc "Pruti">>
You surrender to Pruti, not wanting to anger <<bhim>> any further. The beast's eyes twitch slightly slower as cracks and creaks are heard from <<bhis>> body. The animalistic features fade as Pruti coughs blood and staggers for a moment before steadying <<bhimself>>. 
<br><br>
"Regardless of your surrender, you need to be punished for your disobedience, little doll." Pruti catches <<bhis>> breath and continues. "I'll be keeping a portion of your soul as compensation." One of <<bhis>> long tendrils jabs into you and saps your essence. You feel weak as <<bhe>> retracts the tendril. 
<br><br>
<<if $ghost is 1>>
	"Now..." Another of <<bhis>> tendrils restrains you despite your semi-corporeal state, and <<bhe>> begins to sew you a new cloth body. You feel the stiffness from earlier return as you consciousness seeps into the doll. You're barely able to see what it looks like before you become one with it.  "Never, and I mean never, do this again! If you do... I won't be as lenient."
	<br><br>
	You're placed in a pile of other dolls and restrained with some nearby rope. You lament your predicament as you realize you're back at square one with a doll body identical to what you had before.
<<else>>
	"Now..." <<bHe>> grabs you and begins to sew your cloth body back together. "Never, and I mean never, do this again! If you do... I won't be as lenient."
	<br><br>
	Pruti finishes with the stitching on your body before restraining you with some nearby rope. <<bHe>> extends a tendril towards you, picking you up and dropping you within a pile of other dolls. The tendril is absorbed back into Pruti's body as <<bhe>> slinks away, leaving you alone.
<</if>> 
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut]]>><<trauma 30>><<purity -50>><<physique_loss 16>><</link>>

