:: Pruti Sendoff
<<npc "Pruti">>
Pruti sees you eyeing the door and sighs annoyed. "You do want to leave don't you?" <<bHe>> grumbles. "Look I don't usually do this... but I could free you and let you go." <<bHe>> seems to be having a hard time getting <<bhis>> words out. "Well, what I mean is I usually don't let my tools go, but as long as you come back I wouldn't... exactly be against it." <<bHe>> hesitates for a moment before striking you with <<bhis>> tendril, you feel a sort of severance. "Leave now. Before I change my mind."
<br><br>
<<if $bodyless is 1>>
	<<link [[Exit Pruti's Hut|Misland]]>>
		<<set $islanddistance to 45>>
		<<set $eventskip to 1>>
		<<set Skin.color.natural to "ghost">>
		<<set V.transformationParts.ghost.eyes to "default">>
		<<set V.transformationParts.ghost.hitodama to "default">>
		<<set $haircolour to "ghost">>
		<<set $hairfringecolour to "ghost">>
		<<set $makeup.browscolour to "ghost">>
		<<set $options.lightGlow to 1>>
		<<set $ghost to 1>>
		<<earnFeat "Ghost">>
		<<endevent>>
	<</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Exit Pruti's Hut|Misland]]>><<set $islanddistance to 45>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Pruti Eat
<<npc "Pruti">>
You sit together with Pruti. You know you can't eat but you feel <<bhe>>'ll appreciate the company. You sit together in silence as Pruti eats the dangerously bitter meal before <<bhe>> finishes and washes the wooden platter.
<br><br>
