You approach Pruti. <<bHe>> looks exhausted. You sit and begin to rub <<bhis>> shoulders. <<bHe>> seems a bit taken aback for a moment before looking away and letting you continue. After a while, <<bhe>> glances your way before standing. "Thanks for that, doll. I wasn't expecting it but it was nice."
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><<pass 60>><<endevent>><</link>>

