You enter the bathroom where you find Pruti completely naked. <<bHe>> looks at you unashamed of <<bhis>> nudity. "Yes doll? Did you need something?" You waste no time before picking up a rag and helping <<bhim>> get <<bhis>> back. "Oh you wished to help? I suppose that should be fine." <<bHe>> lets you clean <<bhis>> back before helping you wipe down your body as well.
