:: Pruti Save
You awaken back in Pruti's hut. Pruti has a tendril fed into you that seems to be restoring some of your strength. You smile weakly before sitting up, ready to get back to work.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><</link>>

:: Pruti Request
<<npc Pruti>><<person1>>
Upon hearing your offer, Pruti pulls you to the side. <<bHe>> whispers in a dark tone.
<br><br>
“Oh really? You wish to assist in my studies? Well, a rather troublesome issue has recently come to my attention. After the collapse of the… aircraft. Some foreign contaminant has found its way into the local ecosystem.”
<br><br>
Pruti draws a rough map of the island on a sheet of parchment. From the beaches of the shore to the caldera at its peak. <<bHe>> speaks, “Within the forest near this hut, you can find the wreckage of the machine. Try examining the scene for anything that could offer a sample for me to study.”
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pruti Vial
<<npc Pruti>><<person1>>
You return the vial to Pruti, <<bhe>> examines it with interest. “It appears this glass instrument was used to contain and study the specimen. I should be able to examine this sample more in due time. In the meantime, I have more to request of you. The… creatures have started spreading and infecting many of the native wildlife.”
<br><br>
Pruti returns to <<bhis>> rough map drawn on the parchment. <<bHe>> points to a portion of the desert near the shore. “I have heard rumors through the woods about a colony of ants that have experienced massive unexplainable growth. I require a sample from the nesting chamber and I should be able to make some more progress in my study.” <<bHe>> hands you something that looks like a homemade glass syringe. “Come back once you have the sample.”
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><<set $prutiquest to 3>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pruti Egg
<<npc Pruti>><<person1>>
You return the syringe filled with yellowish fluid mixed with the purple and pale goo. Pruti examines the vial with intrigue. <<bHe>> speaks up after a moment. “This is simply incredible, I have never seen something like this before, and you said there were these… “lurkers” inside of the egg sack with the developing ant?”
<br><br>
Pruti squeezes the mixture into a glass vial alongside the previous sample. “You see, I've been studying this previous sample since you left and it is beyond anything I've seen before. It seems these creatures are… parasitizing other species and manipulating their genetics. If you could find me another sample, I might be able to do something about the destruction of natural order.”
<br><br>
<<bHe>> returns to the map and thinks deeply for a moment. “I've been quite removed from the village for a while, ever since those people from across the sea started debasing this pure land. But despite this, even I've heard the rumors. Deep at the heart of the mountain, within a cave, is a terrible beast. Some have been hunting it as a trophy but none have returned.”
<br><br>
Pruti marks the very end of the map at the peak of the mountain. “If the beast is as horrid as they say, then I have no doubts it is infested. Be careful.” <<bHe>> turns back to <<bhis>> jury-rigged chemistry set and begins to examine the new sample under a slightly luminous purple scope.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><<set $prutiquest to 5>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pruti Bear
<<npc Pruti>><<person1>>
You return to Pruti triumphant. You place the body of one of the strange lurkers on the table. Pruti appears impressed.
<br><br>
“Wow this is an impressive specimen. Comparing it to one from the ant nest, it is drastically different but shares a common root ancestor, they seem to have bred and mutated to an unprecedented degree in a very short time. With this last sample I should be able to create an antibody in due time. It won't be able to help the already mutated creatures like the ants, but it should slow the spread of these creatures, if not kill them off entirely.”
<br><br>
Pruti puts a clawed hand to <<bhis>> face in thought. “Additionally, I may be able to synthesize an enhancement with these strange genetics, it may take a while but the results should be beyond expectations.”
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><<set $prutiquest to 7>><<set $prutitimer to 0>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Pruti Injection
<<npc Pruti>><<person1>>
After a week has passed, you return to find Pruti’s hut a mess. Parchment scatters the floor, the chemistry set is a complete mess, and Pruti stands a bit disheveled perhaps from a lack of sleep. As you enter, Pruti turns with a manic look before <<bhis>> eyes soften. <<bHe>> returns to the messy disordered chemistry set and brushes <<bhis>> hair back to look more orderly.
<br><br>
“Sorry about the state of affairs, this research is just so exciting. I haven't found something of this magnitude since the discovery of Abyssina. This species of creature doesn't even seem to be from this reality. It is truly a sight to behold. Shortly after you left, the specimen came back to life, or perhaps was never dead in the first place.”
<br><br>
“The subject seems to infiltrate the hosts body and inflict them with severe delirium before taking over entirely.” <<bHe>> removes a vial of the pale purple goo and presents it toward you. “This is an altered embryo that should grant you the ability to use this creature’s abilities with much less severe drawbacks.” <<bHe>> hands you the vial full of sludge containing a small orangish egg. “It should be fine, just try not to overuse the power this will grant you. Find a place to inject this and its power will be yours.”
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Witch Hut Trust]]>><<set $prutiquest to 9>><<endevent>><</link>>